  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DMF III Debt Management Facility 2019-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The facility will have the specific objective of:
Strenghten debt management to reduce debt related vulnerabilities and imrpove debt transparency. 
Provide customized advice  on sovereign debt management through the design and application of analytical tools
Provision of tailored services and implementation support, training and webinars</narrative>
  </description>
